[
    {
        "content": "<p>I'm looking for the theorem that if L/K is some field extension, then for any valuation v on the field K there is some valuation on the extension field L, possibly taking values in a larger value group, which restricts to v on K.</p>",
        "id": 597669846,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1779733445
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>cc <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"406490\">@María Inés de Frutos Fernández</span><br>\nYou may have a look at <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/Analysis/Normed/Unbundled/SpectralNorm.html\">https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/Analysis/Normed/Unbundled/SpectralNorm.html</a>. It's in terms of valuation, but mathematically it's the same results (at least in some cases).</p>",
        "id": 597672967,
        "sender_full_name": "Riccardo Brasca",
        "timestamp": 1779735316
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I don't think that file has what I want. I'm only seeing results about normed things, not valued things, and I can't convert between them because the value group can be very big.</p>",
        "id": 597673616,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1779735709
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Ah, we have <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=IsLocalRing.exists_factor_valuationRing#doc\">docs#IsLocalRing.exists_factor_valuationRing</a> that seems very relevant</p>",
        "id": 597675028,
        "sender_full_name": "Riccardo Brasca",
        "timestamp": 1779736595
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Basically, given <code>K</code> you introduce the valuation subring <code>A</code>. If <code>A →+* L</code> is the obvious morphism you use <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=IsLocalRing.exists_factor_valuationRing#doc\">docs#IsLocalRing.exists_factor_valuationRing</a> to get <code>B</code>, that is a <code>ValuationSubring L</code>, and now you are in good shape I think.</p>",
        "id": 597675473,
        "sender_full_name": "Riccardo Brasca",
        "timestamp": 1779736810
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>oh! if I input <code>R</code> as the ring of integers of my valuation and I input <code>K</code> as my extension field then this seems to be saying exactly what I want! amazing!</p>",
        "id": 597675501,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1779736826
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>how do I get the embedding of the value groups?</p>",
        "id": 597685131,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1779742476
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Maybe something around <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/RingTheory/Valuation/Extension.html#Valuation.HasExtension\">Valuation.HasExtension</a>?</p>",
        "id": 597689302,
        "sender_full_name": "Riccardo Brasca",
        "timestamp": 1779744562
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>no, I can't find anything with <code>Valuation.HasExtension</code></p>",
        "id": 597712573,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1779757406
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The following is written by codex with the hint of using the lemma above. Is it enough for you?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">noncomputable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">section</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">universe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">uK</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">uL</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">uΓ</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsLocalRing</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">uK</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">uL</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">Γ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">uΓ</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Field</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Field</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">LinearOrderedCommGroupWithZero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Γ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Valuation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Γ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ΓL</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">uL</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearOrderedCommGroupWithZero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ΓL</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Valuation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ΓL</span><span class=\"o\">),</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">Valuation</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">HasExtension</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ValuationSubring</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">valuationSubring</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→+*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">algebraMap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">comp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">subtype</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">obtain</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hVmem</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hVlocal</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsLocalRing</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exists_factor_valuationRing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">refine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ValueGroup</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inferInstance</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">valuation</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?_⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">refine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">val_isEquiv_comap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Valuation</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isEquiv_iff_valuationSubring</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">ext</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Valuation</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_valuationSubring_iff</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Valuation</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_valuationSubring_iff</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Valuation</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">comap_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ValuationSubring</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">valuation_le_one_iff</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hVmem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">by_contra</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hxO</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx_ne_zero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx_zero</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hxO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hx_zero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">▸</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_mem</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hinvO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">⁻¹</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_or_inv_mem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resolve_left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hxO</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hinv_nonunit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">⁻¹</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hinvO</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">maximalIdeal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">mem_maximalIdeal</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mem_nonunits_iff</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hunit</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx_mem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">obtain</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isUnit_iff_exists_inv</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hunit</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hyx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"n\">simpa</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Subtype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ext_iff</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inv_mul_eq_iff_eq_mul₀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx_ne_zero</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">using</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hyx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">▸</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hxO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx_mem</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→+*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">codRestrict</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hVmem</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hg_local</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsLocalHom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">change</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsLocalHom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">codRestrict</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSubring</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hVmem</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hVlocal</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">letI</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsLocalHom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hg_local</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hinv_image_nonunit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">⁻¹</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hinvO</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">maximalIdeal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">map_nonunit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hinv_nonunit</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hinv_image_unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">IsUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">⁻¹</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hinvO</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">refine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isUnit_iff_exists_inv</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mpr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨⟨</span><span class=\"n\">algebraMap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?_⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">ext</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx_ne_zero</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mem_maximalIdeal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hinv_image_nonunit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hinv_image_unit</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
